DGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9055d2af1337ec5cEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_PlantsFaerun</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_PlantsFaerun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_PlantsFaerun\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2ec5ceb8-eacd-4570-b935-ee0f250c6ddb</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2ec5ceb8-eacd-4570-b935-ee0f250c6ddb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2ec5ceb8-eacd-4570-b935-ee0f250c6ddb\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's Apothecary</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-20&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-36</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[In his debut work <i>Don't Sniff the Specimen</i>, Professor Olimuncle Shrewsburry lays out in languid detail his experriences cataloguing the many plants and mushrooms he encountered along the highways and herby woodlands of Faerûn.\n</p><p><br>\nHe discusses the odd property of <a href=\"/wiki/Daggerroot\" title=\"Daggerroot\">Daggerroot</a> which grows near dungeon entrances; <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecap\" title=\"Bonecap\">Bonecap</a> which blooms near corpses; the rich and dangerous alchemical properties of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yellow_musk_creeper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yellow Musk Creeper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yellow_musk_creeper\">Yellow Musk Creeper</a></span>; and much more over... gosh, this book is over two-thousand pages long.\n</p><p><br>\nNot including appendices.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_Prod_the_Specimen\" title=\"Don't Prod the Specimen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_Prod_the_Specimen\" title=\"Don't Prod the Specimen\">Don't Prod the Specimen</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_Swallow_the_Specimen\" title=\"Don't Swallow the Specimen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_Swallow_the_Specimen\" title=\"Don't Swallow the Specimen\">Don't Swallow the Specimen</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203154\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 second